# Example Meta API Key file for testing (docs/GDD.md, Zadanie D15).
# Copy this file to secrets/meta_api_key.txt and paste your Meta Model API key here.
# secrets/meta_api_key.txt is ignored by git and will never be committed.
#
# Hierarchy: Settings UI field > secrets/meta_api_key.txt > local fallback (no key).
#
# Format: plain key string on a single line, e.g.:
# META_API_KEY=your_meta_api_key_here
# or just:
# your_meta_api_key_here
